{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- WELCOME TO ISEKAI! -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little witch just summoned you instead of a cute little dragon she want to make contract with. Even so, she will take responsible to find out how to return you back to your world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now you get lost in another world, there is no place to stay and no one would give you a free house or a big abandoned farm.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Don't worry!</strong>\u00a0<strong>The people are so friendly!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socialize with everyone in the town, you might be get something in return. Or maybe.... one of them will fall in love with you. Who knows? You can marry and have a child, decision is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/344a54dea7f7b5521f37d3c4ada070b5.poster.avif?t=1772060503\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/344a54dea7f7b5521f37d3c4ada070b5.webm?t=1772060503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/344a54dea7f7b5521f37d3c4ada070b5.mp4?t=1772060503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JOIN ADVENTURE GUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By join to Adventure Guild, Joseph will let you stay at inn free for 1 year. increase your adventure rank, explore unknown area, completing dozens of quests and find the hidden mystery of Moonspring Vale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/c149f250f72caaccaa3e765cba690450.poster.avif?t=1772060503\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/c149f250f72caaccaa3e765cba690450.webm?t=1772060503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/c149f250f72caaccaa3e765cba690450.mp4?t=1772060503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JOIN TO MONSTER RAID EVENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After increase Adventure Rank to D you received certificate to raid dungeon or going to battle field and fight monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/1e0f9d6920c6c3f71cea5363ae839d86.poster.avif?t=1772060503\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/1e0f9d6920c6c3f71cea5363ae839d86.webm?t=1772060503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/1e0f9d6920c6c3f71cea5363ae839d86.mp4?t=1772060503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUY ABANDONED FARM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you earned some Gold, you can buy abandoned farm located on the east of Moonspring Vale. farming and raising livestock or building infrastructure for your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/95750bcf59561f